# Held awake with the lid shut and forgotten in a bag. Heat is the danger in there:
# the case heats with nowhere for it to go, at critical temperature awake gives up
# the lid, forced or not, and the Mac sleeps and cools. And if the bag stays cool,
# the battery floor ends it with charge to spare.
